"\n"MOVIE-97A5D9C7-AE53-4F21-9591-31413E66BB45","Fox Searchlight","165","Drama","4046336"," PG-13","2010-02-07","512844","My Name Is Khan"\n"MOVIE-0C5C22FF-7A18-4EB4-AEEC-4898EDAC1202","","133","","","","1951-10-01","","The Red Shoes"\n"MOVIE-E177E8A1-BE68-4108-AB49-327B6A688DB3","","121","","","","2001-12-14","","Lantana"\n"MOVIE-B968FE7B-585F-4F71-9754-40C68C94C666","","92","","","","2010-02-08","","Mary and Max"\n"MOVIE-E70800C3-6029-455F-AA1A-E39777851EE6","","89","","","","2010-02-08","","The Jammed"\n"MOVIE-04F37A92-3E2C-4EAA-A91E-765546EE9D02","Apparition","105","Thriller/Suspense","406216"," R","2010-02-08","51485","The Square"\n"MOVIE-6EC17052-FDD6-4082-A766-7DD1F1641DA2","","0","","","","1990-09-29","","Nouvelle Vague"\n"MOVIE-3AB430E7-D4A7-4336-84D8-C09177B7CB7D","","111","","","","2010-02-08","","Balibo"\n"MOVIE-35CA46AB-50F4-4572-94F8-EBCA53D4373E","","0","","","","2009-08-21","","Twentieth Century Boys: Chapter Two - The Last Hope"\n"MOVIE-40918C92-BE09-4AF1-A390-8935885B58A0","","86","","","","2010-02-09","","Eamon"\n"MOVIE-8E88344C-726B-44F3-BE65-5810A7B0C6E5","","0","","","","2008-02-10","","Kings"';<html>	<head>		<style type="text/css">			img {				width: 400px;			}		</style>	</head>	<body>		<p>Hello ::PERSON_NAME::,</p>		<p>You have been granted access to the ::SOLUTION:: database.</p>		<p>Please follow the instructions below to gain access to the database.</p>		<p>Firstly, you&#8217;ll need to have FileMaker Pro 12 installed. If you don&#8217;t already have this application then you will have to contact IT Support to obtain a copy.</p>		<p>Once you have FileMaker Pro installed, follow these steps to open the database:</p>		<ol>			<li>				From the <em>File</em> menu, choose <em>Open Remote.</em> You'll be presented with the following dialog.<br/>				‡‡CODE[15]‡‡			</li>			<li>				Ensure that <em>Favorite Hosts</em> is selected in the <em>View</em> field. Then click the <em>Add</em> button.			</li>			<li>				A new dialog will appear (see below). Enter the following value for <em>Host's Internet Address: </em> ::SERVER_ADDRESS::<br/>				The <em>Favorite Host's Name</em> value can be whatever you wish.<br/>				‡‡CODE[16]‡‡			</li>			<li>				Click <em>Save</em> and you should be back at the first screen.<br/>			</li>			<li>				Select your new entry from the <em>Hosts</em> list on the left.			</li>			<li>				From the <em>Available Files</em> list on the right, select <em>::SOLUTION::</em>. Then click <em>Open</em>.			</li>			<li>				Enter the following credentials:<br/>				<table>					<tr><td>Account Name:</td><td><b>::ACCOUNT::</b></td></tr>					<tr><td>Password:</td><td><b>::PASSWORD::</b></td></tr>				</table>			</li>			<li>				You will then be asked to change your password. This only happens the first time you log in. Enter a secure (but <a href="http://xkcd.com/936/">memorable</a>!) password and continue into the database.			</li>		</ol>		<p>Let me know if you have any questions or need help.</p>		<p>::ADMIN_NAME::<br/>::ADMIN_EMAIL::</p>	</body></html><img src="data:img/png;base64,/9j/4AAQSkZJRgABAQEAkACQAAD/2wBDAAQDAwQDAwQEAwQFBAQFBgoHBgYGBgwJCQcKDw0PDw4NDg4QEhcUEBEWEQ4OFBwUFhgZGhoaEBMdHxwZHhcaGhn/2wBDAQQFBQYFBgwHBwwZEQ4RGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRkZGRn/wAARCAJ8A2ADASIAAhEBAxEB/8QAHAABAAIDAQEBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAUGAgQHAwEI/8QAYBAAAQMCAQYFCxAHBgIIBwEBAAECAwQFEQYSExQxYQcWIVWUFUFRUlRxkZPR0tMYIjIzNkJTVmJydZKksbKzFzdzdIGh4SMmNESVo2SDCCQlQ0VjhME1RoK0w/DxwmX/xAAZAQEBAQEBAQAAAAAAAAAAAAAABAEDAgb/xAAnEQEAAQIEBwEBAQEBAAAAAAAAAQIEAxJSkRMUMTJRcbFyESFhYv/aAAwDAQACEQMRAD8A/fwAAAAAAAAAAA+YjED6D5iM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDOA+g+ZwzgPoPmcM4D6D5nDED6D5iMQPoAAAAAAAAAAAAA