lone (Evangerion shin gekijôban: Jo)"\n"MOVIE-75F21558-99D6-4176-B574-C0ABF1FFC7F4","","0","","","","","","The Endless Summer (1966)"\n"MOVIE-D3E3CCC8-784D-4C37-BD13-B585043EF155","","0","","","","","","The Endless Summer II"\n"MOVIE-621FF3EE-38A2-4C24-94CA-198D1909EB68","","0","","","","","","Love Me Tonight (1932)"\n"MOVIE-922C0CF0-EDBE-4E16-A9CE-14A8993FE1B5","","0","","","","","","Trouble in Paradise (1932)"\n"MOVIE-BC00B6B8-71F2-4EEE-ACC1-BF1EF249EB02","Shadow","103","","6526","  ","","827","Under Our Skin"\n"MOVIE-E0CC6395-0FD4-487D-A56F-FB723B39074B","Paladin","96","Drama","22878"," R","","2900","Handsome Harry"\n"MOVIE-C4535250-F5A2-49D8-8E0F-306AC9A1641C","","87","","","","","","Etienne!"\n"MOVIE-FE848990-BAEB-4443-87A5-C8FFDBF924BB","","0","","","","","","Mount St. Elias"\n"MOVIE-EC53C3E4-ED2E-4EA3-9D6B-88259A7F078E","","0","","","","","","Nightmare (1956)"\n"MOVIE-FF28E642-8F80-4962-AD1F-2B8B543063A5","","0","","","","","","The Mark of the Whistler"\n"MOVIE-9D2808B6-CC7B-47FD-8F7E-0014E849C96A","","0","","","","","","It\x27s A Mad, Mad, Mad, Mad World"\n"MOVIE-D6BF8F89-59D3-4D13-9015-6BDBC26E19B2","","86","","","","","","Call + Response"\n"MOVIE-03250996-6CB5-4AFC-8E44-4D9CC6050B1A","","0","","","","","","Jealousy (1945)"\n"MOVIE-61C41133-480E-4E66-B9DA-EA09F7685DFC","","0","","","","","","The Lady Confesses (1945)"\n"MOVIE-56FA8033-1759-4BD5-BAB6-346608A949F4","","0","","","","","","National Theatre Live: The Habit of Art"\n"MOVIE-5037518C-65CE-4355-B09F-E0AEDE5A6897","","0","","","","","","The Invisible Wall"\n"MOVIE-EF42852C-A16F-410C-BC42-E17085F370E3","","0","","","","","","Treasure of Monte Cristo (1949)"\n"MOVIE-4A7EAA83-383A-4EB8-A497-9720435040E8","","107","","","","","","Les Diaboliques"';<html>	<head>		<style type="text/css">			img {				width: 400px;			}		</style>	</head>	<body>		<p>Hello ::PERSON_NAME::,</p>		<p>You have been granted access to the ::SOLUTION:: database.</p>		<p>Please follow the instructions below to gain access to the database.</p>		<p>Firstly, you&#8217;ll need to have FileMaker Pro 12 installed. If you don&#8217;t already have this application then you will have to contact IT Support to obtain a copy.</p>		<p>Once you have FileMaker Pro installed, follow these steps to open the database:</p>		<ol>			<li>				From the <em>File</em> menu, choose <em>Open Remote.</em> You'll be presented with the following dialog.<br/>							</li>			<li>				Ensure that <em>Favorite Hosts</em> is selected in the <em>View</em> field. Then click the <em>Add</em> button.			</li>			<li>				A new dialog will appear (see below). Enter the following value for <em>Host's Internet Address: </em> ::SERVER_ADDRESS::<br/>				The <em>Favorite Host's Name</em> value can be whatever you wish.<br/>							</li>			<li>				Click <em>Save</em> and you should be back at the first screen.<br/>			</li>			<li>				Select your new entry from the <em>Hosts</em> list on the left.			</li>			<li>				From the <em>Available Files</em> list on the right, select <em>::SOLUTION::</em>. Then click <em>Open</em>.			</li>			<li>				Enter the following credentials:<br/>				<table>					<tr><td>Account Name:</td><td><b>::ACCOUNT::</b></td></tr>					<tr><td>Password:</td><td><b>::PASSWORD::</b></td></tr>				</table>			</li>			<li>				You will then be asked to change your password. This only happens the first time you log in. Enter a secure (but <a href="http://xkcd.com/936/">memorable</a>!) password and continue into the database.			</li>		</ol>		<p>Let me know if you have any questions or need help.</p>		<p>::ADMIN_NAME::<br/>::ADMIN_EMAIL::</p>	</body></html>